ChorusDraft 0.51.1 — security testing (unreleased)
Modification notice — September 5, 2026

This distribution is a modified work based on the feature sets of Bluesky Bot
1.0.3 and Mastodon Bot 1.0.2, authored by Buntatoes and distributed under the
GNU General Public License version 3.

For version 0.50, the programs were reimplemented as a shared Ruby codebase,
renamed ChorusDraft, and given new publication review, privacy,
harassment prevention, state isolation, and release packaging controls. The
complete user-visible change list is in CHANGELOG.md.

Version 0.51 adds a shared comic voice for original drafts, replies, and public
commentary while retaining publication review and harassment prevention controls.

Version 0.51.1 testing hardens opt-out processing, do-not-contact checks for
mentions, Unicode screening, and Mastodon content-warning validation.

